-    hash; shared by census + reproduce_review so replay byte-matches."""
+    hash; shared by census + reproduce_review so replay byte-matches.
+
+    COVERAGE (external re-audit of 6d6bacad, finding 3): a tally is a count over the input set it was
+    taken on. When the tally names its covered PMIDs, the rows of the CURRENT primary pool it does not
+    cover are named (glp1: the tally of 2026-09-11 covers 7 of the 8 pooled rows; SOUL, pooled two days
+    later, is outside it); a tally that names no covered set has coverage NOT_ESTABLISHED. The page
+    never states 'n of n checkable' as if it covered the pool."""
     p = os.path.join(root, "docs", "dual_extract.json")
     if not slug or not os.path.exists(p):
